<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013) & Short et al. (2014) GDNF-RET-Wnt11-Sprouty1 kidney ureteric bud Turing branching morphogenesis (Mouse embryonic metanephric kidney ureteric bud & cap mesenchyme (Mus musculus, E11.5-E15.5))",
        "Menshykau & Iber (2013) & Short et al. (2014) GDNF-RET-Wnt11-Sprouty1 kidney ureteric bud Turing branching morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Mouse embryonic metanephric kidney ureteric bud & cap mesenchyme (Mus musculus, E11.5-E15.5) morphology" ;
