    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mouse embryonic metanephric kidney ureteric bud & cap mesenchyme (Mus musculus, E11.5-E15.5) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py> ;
